# AI-OS

AGENTS.md is the canonical instruction file for this repository. Cursor reads
it through this adapter, per the Tool-Agnostic Runtime Contract in AGENTS.md.

Read and follow AGENTS.md fully. Operating rules, branching policy, memory
authority, skill resolution, and hook conventions all live there.

Tool-level Cursor defaults must not outrank AI-OS. If a global Cursor rule
conflicts with AGENTS.md, neutralize it or scope it away from this repo.

Note on automation: AI-OS's automatic "keep the primary checkout clean"
SessionEnd autosave runs in Claude Code and Codex sessions. Cursor cannot
run hooks, so a Cursor-only session may leave the primary checkout dirty;
the next Claude or Codex session will clean it. If you see a Stash /
Discard / Commit box in Claude Desktop, click Commit. Never Discard.

@AGENTS.md
